{"parse": {"title": "交接日-04", "pageid": 123639, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%8E%A5%E6%97%A5-03\" title=\"交接日-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">交接日-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%8E%A5%E6%97%A5-05\" title=\"交接日-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">交接日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9C.AA.E9.A9.AF.E5.8C.96.E7.9A.84.E5.A5.BD.E5.A5.87\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"未驯化的好奇\">未驯化的好奇</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 未驯化的好奇</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Curiosity Unspoiled</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">10:45 教学楼前</span></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 06.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">教学楼前</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>男孩：</b></span>“我不想去禁闭室！那里又黑、又冷……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“还有小狗那么大的老鼠咬人！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“求你了，这次就放过我们吧，好吗？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>在前往禁闭室的路上，两个孩子一直不停哀求，玛蒂尔达险些就要心软了——她也不是没有这样做过。<br />\n毕竟犯了错是要接受惩罚没错，但那本该最多是一个星期不准吃甜食、一个月零花钱减半……<br />\n她知道禁闭室是个什么样的地方。那里有些坏心眼的设计，用于“让坏孩子们长长记性”。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“……不行，规矩就是规矩。如果你们不想去禁闭室，就不该做那么危险的事情。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>或者不要被捉到。玛蒂尔达在心里补上后半句，最终狠心拒绝。<br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_09.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 09.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/Rolestory_madierda_pic_09.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/Rolestory_madierda_pic_09.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/Rolestory_madierda_pic_09.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<p>在孩子们的哀嚎声中，她用余光看了一眼仍旧沉默地跟在身后的拉文德。<br />\n她果不其然低下头在笔记本上又写了些什么。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 12.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">禁闭室</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“这间……不行，正对着风口，会吹感冒的。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“这一间……地上怎么有这么多积水？这可不卫生！之后得打扫一下了。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达打开一间禁闭室的门，随后又关上，直到只剩下最后一间。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“怎么有这么多沙米尔虫？我明明之前已经把它们清理掉了！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“但……算了，看起来只有这里了。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>见玛蒂尔达跨进禁闭室内，两个孩子立刻吓白了脸。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“可是——”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“别担心，我会把这些家伙赶出去的。”<br />\n<small style=\"color: #999;\">释放神秘术“火光灼灼”</small><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 12.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<p>炽热的火舌燎过冰冷的地砖，蜷缩在角落的沙米尔虫受了惊，争先恐后地从门缝里跑了出去。<br />\n等最后一只沙米尔虫逃出房间后，原本略有些阴冷的房间已经温暖了许多。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“我记得工作手册上并没有提过，在将学生送进禁闭室前需要清理室内环境。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>这是这名继任者第一次提问。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“但也没说不能这么做。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“……我明白了。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达看到拉文德睁大了眼睛，在迟疑片刻后提笔翻开了笔记本——也不知道她会写下什么。<br />\n但无论如何，玛蒂尔达也做不到把两个看起来刚开始学《神秘术入门》的孩子和一窝沙米尔虫关在一间房里。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“好了，进去吧。按规定，你们至少得待到晚上。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“一会儿我会来检查，只要你们老老实实反省了，至少还能赶上晚饭……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达正欲离开，却发现自己被拽住了衣角。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>男孩：</b></span>“你能留下吗？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“大家都出学校玩去了，只有我们两个待在这种地方，太没意思了……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达想起一个问题。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“今天不是校外活动日吗？你们两个怎么会还在学校里？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“我们当然也想去了！但是……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“……他们两个不知道从哪里找到了从前的学生留下的笔记本，按照上面写的做了一个‘足球’，打碎了教学楼二楼的窗户。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>男孩：</b></span>“对不起……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“我们只是好奇！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>女孩涨红了脸。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“我们想知道外面是什么样的，外面的人都在做什么！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“这是不被允许的。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“《第一防线学生守则》上写了，学生未经许可，不得接触校外的事物。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“但是有教职员监管就可以了，不是吗？不然就不会有校外巡礼和校外活动日了！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>女孩气鼓鼓地瞪了拉文德一眼，手上紧紧抓着玛蒂尔达的衣角。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“和我们讲讲你做‘特派调查员’的故事吧！我听到你刚才和那个大哥哥聊天时说的话了，你去过很多地方，对不对？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“印度、美国……我只在书上看过这些名字！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>男孩：</b></span>“求求你了！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>所有的视线凝聚在了玛蒂尔达的身上，她不打算说“不”。<br />\n</p></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "交接日-04"}}